&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we scale to reach orbit, we are looking for a Senior Talent Attraction Specialist to build and own some of the most high-leverage, relationship-driven parts of our recruiting function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who thrives in fast-paced, high-growth environments and loves the hunt — bringing proven recruiting expertise to shape how we hire and grow. You will work closely with hiring managers and our leadership team on complex, high-impact roles, coach other recruiters on the team, and take ownership of some of our most business-critical hiring processes from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted recruiting advisor to hiring managers and our leadership team, anticipating hiring needs and independently choosing the right approach for complex or cross-functional roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring market insights and recruiting expertise to the table to influence hiring decisions, and build long-term stakeholder relationships across the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and drive sourcing strategies for hard-to-fill or high-impact roles, building and continuously improving talent pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a first point of contact and senior brand ambassador for Isar Aerospace, representing the company confidently in complex or high-stakes candidate conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own multiple concurrent and complex recruitment processes, anticipating bottlenecks and adjusting priorities independently to deliver results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and coach interviewers on structured hiring techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own recruiting KPIs for your area, using data to identify process improvements and share insights with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualification Checklist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in business, psychology, HR, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full-cycle recruiting experience, including experience in a fast-paced, high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of independently managing complex or cross-functional hiring processes and influencing hiring decisions at the stakeholder level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing sourcing strategies and coaching or mentoring others&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident working with different recruiting tools, experience with Greenhouse as ATS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, negotiation, and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding organization and attention to detail, even across multiple concurrent processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Swedish, Norwegian or French is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
