&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This senior leadership role&lt;/strong&gt; will lead Partner Sales for the&amp;nbsp; Central EMEA region (Germany. CH, Austria eastern Europe), focused on consulting and Systems Integrator (C&amp;amp;SI) partners, as a member of the Regional Leadership Team. The regional leader will build the regional ecosystem strategy and plan aligned with regional and functional priorities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
